{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark with up to 6 players on an underwater adventure to uncover treasures, shipwrecks, resources, or forgotten creatures. You\u2019ll also almost certainly find death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.webp?t=1770647127\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.poster.avif?t=1770647127\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.poster.avif?t=1770647127\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.webm?t=1770647127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.mp4?t=1770647127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print your gear, assign roles, and craft a careful strategy. Or just charge in headfirst\u2014whatever floats your submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.webp?t=1770647127\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.poster.avif?t=1770647127\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=